d the corresponding December 2025 TTM are supported. I2 remains secondInterim, twelve months, never an annual/H2 merely because its accounting-basis group matches.","FY2024 is separately tagged 1009-leasing-to-principal-casino-transition because the direct casino takeover in May 2024 falls inside that year whereas December 2023 H1 predates it. No unreviewed leasing-to-principal revenue bridge is assumed. Football-discontinued and earlier fiscal-transition presentations remain separate.","All provider annual history through official audited FY2025 is reviewed. Provider FY2026 ending June is actually a twelve-month second interim: primary note 2 confirms year end changed from June to December on 2026-05-13. Expected transition FY is eighteen months 2025-07-01 to 2026-12-31; no final FY result exists in these sources.","FY2019 is fifteen months 2018-04-01 to 2019-06-30, not twelve months. September 2018 comparative is a genuine April-September six-month period and must not be relabelled December 2018.","Provider anomalous dates 2018-01-31, 2017-01-31 and calendar June observations cannot be certified as issuer H1 merely from labels. Canonical dates above follow the actual tables. Provider Q1/Q3 or a stand-alone Q2 must not be treated as cumulative H1 without reconciliation.","Latest first-interim notes disclose depreciation 49982/47979 and the balance sheet still carries intangible assets 3275/5386, but no complete matching intangible-amortization expense is disclosed in that report; full D&A remains null rather than inferring amortization from balance changes. FY2020 continuing-only D&A uses note 9's 48255 depreciation; note 4 allocates all 52589 amortization to discontinued football, excluded from continuing D&A.","Reported GP survives gaming-tax reconciliation: for FY2025 cost of sales alone is 112183 and gaming-tax/licensing expense is 180731. Our aggregate costOfRevenue is 292914, not a universal revenue gross-up.","Total attributable FY2020 NI and continuing attributable NI are separately preserved, with actual attributable continuing values printed on the following page. The FY2021 report has an audit qualification concerning comparative disposed-football information.","All per-share data is HKD per share, not HK cents or thousands; comparability tags deliberately distinguish calendar/fiscal transitions and known re-presentations."],"incomeHistoryPolicy":"reviewedPeriodsOnly"}}
